## Installation and Setup

1. Install XAMPP on your computer.
2. Clone or download this repository.
3. Place the project folder inside the XAMPP `htdocs` directory.
4. Start Apache and MySQL from the XAMPP Control Panel.
5. Open phpMyAdmin and create the project database.
6. Import the project SQL file, if available.
7. Configure your database connection settings in the project.
8. Open your browser and visit:

```text
http://localhost/ClassSense/
```

## Project Objective

The main objective of ClassSense is to improve classroom communication between students and teachers by making student understanding visible through real-time learning feedback.

